From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: 5656565566 <contact@home56.top>
Date: Fri, 7 Aug 2026 19:16:54 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Allow Floral Wi-Fi AIDL dependency in updatable modules

The Wi-Fi mainline module uses the stable Floral Wi-Fi AIDL client to
publish framework state changes to the vendor simulation service. Add the
generated Java library to the Android 12 APEX dependency allowlist.

---
 build/allowed_deps.txt | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/build/allowed_deps.txt b/build/allowed_deps.txt
index 4567deefdb28..ad589700a3d1 100644
--- a/build/allowed_deps.txt
+++ b/build/allowed_deps.txt
@@ -192,6 +192,7 @@ ExtServices(minSdkVersion:current)
 ExtServices-core(minSdkVersion:30)
 ExtServices-core(minSdkVersion:current)
 flatbuffer_headers(minSdkVersion:(no version))
+floral.device.wifi-V1-java(minSdkVersion:30)
 fmtlib(minSdkVersion:29)
 fmtlib_ndk(minSdkVersion:29)
 framework-mediaprovider(minSdkVersion:30)
-- 
2.47.3

